<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.bundle.restores ~ a bundle comes back onto the vessel

`lares vault restore <file>` opens a backup bundle on a route the hand types and lands its face at the next free index (`--as <N>`: that index); `--memory` lands the keys on the seat of the face the daemon mount runs under and takes no `--as`. `--cards` rebuilds a root from paper cards read on the terminal, with no bundle file and no memory: `--as <N>` the free index and `--face <key|persona-…>` the root to rebuild.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ restore · as · cards

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`restore` params=`file/h2.bundle ~ restore a bundle at the next free index`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`as` params=`file/h2.bundle as/3 ~ restore it at index 3`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`cards` params=`cards/true as/3 face/persona-abc ~ rebuild a root from paper cards at index 3`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · as · memory · cards · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path seat/1 as/<file> ~ the bundle file; absent under --cards`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`as` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the free index the face lands at`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`memory` params=`~ land the keys on the seat of the face the mount runs under`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cards` params=`~ rebuild a root from paper cards on a terminal`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/key-or-prefix ~ under --cards, the root to rebuild by its public key or prefix`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the bundle's route, or reads the cards, at their own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · no-vessel · bundle-unreadable · bundle-malformed · no-slot-opens · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.bundle.restores file/h2.bundle]] ~ no file; --as beside --memory; --cards beside a file or --memory; --cards with no --as or --face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`no-vessel` params=`~ no vessel stands on this store`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bundle-unreadable` params=`cure/[[face.bundle.restores file/h2.bundle]] ~ no bundle reads at the path`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bundle-malformed` params=`~ the file reads as no face bundle`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`no-slot-opens` params=`~ the route typed opens none of the bundle's slots`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ restored

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`restored` params=`exit/0 ~ the face landed; the lines name its index, or the keys imported under --memory`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

